{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting variety of 10 new betta fish for your collection! These will appear in an\u00a0<strong>in-game DLC store</strong> as well as appropriate existing stores for their species. Here\u2019s what you\u2019re getting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koi Dumbo Plakat Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Red Dumbo Plakat Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Veiltail Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Koi Veiltail Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Dragon Plakat Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Dragon Plakat Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Halfmoon Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magenta Halfmoon Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Double Tail Plakat Betta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koi Double Tail Plakat Betta</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925080/extras/898818006d882c932e3975d2d3fc809d.avif?t=1757953630\" width=1080 height=2000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As always, all fish have had their behavior designed to match their real-life counterparts as closely as we can with our systems, but please feel free to reach out to us if you see anything funky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: these fish will not all appear at once in your DLC store and will still be subject to random-spawning within the DLC store. The exact fish you want might not show up right away, but it shouldn\u2019t take long!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925080?t=1757953630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925080?t=1757953630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a